# `towncrier` collects the fragments under `changelog.d/` into
# `CHANGELOG.md`, and the `changelog` env in `tox.ini` runs it.
#
# Standalone rather than compiled together with `test.in`: the
# validator beside it -- `tests/_changelog.py` -- is written against
# the standard library alone and never imports this, precisely so that
# the check `release.yml` depends on does not depend on a resolver.
# What `towncrier` is here for is rendering, which is the half a human
# looks at.
towncrier
